Section 1 (Miss. Code § 45-9-101(5)(c)): The department shall not charge a fee for issuance of a license under this section;
Section 1 (Miss. Code § 45-9-101(5)(d)): A full set of fingerprints of the applicant administered by the Department of Public Safety; costs for processing the set of fingerprints as required by this subsection (5) shall be borne by the Department of Public Safety;
Section 1 (Miss. Code § 45-9-101, renewal): The department shall not charge a renewal fee.
